    "sections": {
        "description": "SKT Chemical is designed for  industrial compounds. It can also be used for industries related to substances, materials, formulations, and solutions. It is ideal for chemical manufacturers, laboratories, research firms, and processing units that work with agents, reagents, catalysts, solvents, and synthetic materials. The theme offers a clean layout that helps you present your products, services, and compositions with clarity and trust. With easy customization options, you can showcase your active ingredients, raw materials, and treatment solutions in a structured and visually appealing way. It is built using Elementor page builder. Built with SEO-friendly coding and fast-loading performance, SKT Chemical ensures better online visibility for companies in the biochemical, industrial, and manufacturing sectors. It is fully responsive and works smoothly across all devices. Whether you are promoting chemical products, research services, or specialized blends, this theme provides all the tools needed to build a strong digital presence and attract potential clients effortlessly. Document: https://sktthemesdemo.net/documentation/solar-energy-documentation/"
    },
